<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detection Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the detection sphere let you see what is hidden from the normal eye: the invisible, the living and the undead, magic, poison and alignment, and the nature of the things you find. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist such spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>detect alignment    paladin 0, healer 5, necromancer 6, druid 12
detect invisible    conjurer 10, sorcerer 11, assassin 15
detect magic        conjurer 0, sorcerer 0
detect poison       paladin 4, necromancer 5, healer 6, druid 16
detect undead       necromancer 0, healer 5, paladin 9
detect curse        necromancer 1, healer 11
sense life          druid 1, necromancer 2, ranger 6, dark knight 9, healer 14
identify            conjurer 11, sorcerer 12
improved identify   conjurer 21, sorcerer 28
sense invisible     dark knight 0, druid 6, ranger 28
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
